diff --git a/svc/docs/API.md b/svc/docs/API.md
index d96c758..69fc7f2 100644
--- a/svc/docs/API.md
+++ b/svc/docs/API.md
@@ -6,5 +6,20 @@
 | GET | /users | All users, by id. |
 | GET | /users/<id> | One user, or 404. |
 | POST | /users | Create a user from `{name, email}`. 201, 400 on invalid input, 409 if the email is taken. |
+| POST | /users/import | Create many users, all or nothing. See below. |
+
+### POST /users/import
+
+Body: `{"users": [{"name": ..., "email": ...}, ...]}`. Each entry is validated like `POST /users`. If any entry is rejected, no user is created.
+
+| Status | When | Body |
+|---|---|---|
+| 201 | All created | `{"users": [...]}`, in input order |
+| 400 | `users` missing, empty or not a list | `{"errors": ["users must be a non-empty list"]}` |
+| 400 | An entry is not an object or fails validation | `{"errors": [{"index": i, "errors": [...]}]}` |
+| 409 | An email already exists, or appears earlier in the batch (capitalisation ignored) | `{"errors": [{"index": i, "error": "email already registered"}]}`, `i` being the later entry |
+| 413 | More than 100 users | `{"error": "at most 100 users per request"}` |
+
+Checks run in the order 413, 400, 409: duplicates are only reported when every entry is valid.
 
 A user is `{id, name, email}`.
